		(property "Note" "OFF_BOARD / WIRED SPEAKER / 8R >=0.5W / SKU FINALIZES WITH ENCLOSURE. Implementation is OPTION C, off-board wired speaker. The MAX98357A differential output path is unchanged: U5 OUTP -> SPK_P and U5 OUTN -> SPK_N, brought to the board edge at J6 and out to the speaker on a crimped lead. LS1 is marked exclude-from-board, so it is intentionally footprintless and must NOT be counted as a missing board footprint. Target class 8 ohm, >=0.5 W, ~15 mm; exact SKU is deferred to enclosure/mechanical selection."
			(at 241.3 72.39 0)
			(hide yes)
