	(text "SPEAKER IS OFF-BOARD\n\nOFF-BOARD SPEAKER\n8R >=0.5W\nJST PH 2.0 mm\nENCLOSURE-MOUNTED\n\nLS1 represents the wired speaker beyond J6 and is EXCLUDED FROM THE BOARD.\nJ6 pin 1 = SPK_P = MAX98357A OUTP\nJ6 pin 2 = SPK_N = MAX98357A OUTN\nOBSERVE POLARITY WHEN CRIMPING\n\nSpeaker SKU finalises with the enclosure."
